    "explanation": "The release describes federal funds Iowa will receive to combat gun crimes under Project Safe Neighborhoods and attributes the funding outcome to the senator’s efforts. Rule 1 applies because the senator is credited with securing a concrete governmental benefit/funding award. Rule 2 does not apply because no legislative authorship or sponsorship is claimed.",
